Package: ffmpeggui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: ffmpeg
Description: GUI frontend for ffmpeg
 ffmpegGUI drives ffmpeg from a plain window: pick a source file and an
 output preset, watch per-job progress, crop the picture, extract preview
 frames, queue jobs in a manager and copy the generated command line for
 manual runs. The ffmpeg and ffprobe executables are needed at runtime.
